        "query": "with old as (\n  select phone from leads\n  where last_message_at < now() - interval '12 months'\n),\nchats as (\n  delete from n8n_chat_histories\n  where session_id in (select phone from old)\n)\ndelete from leads\nwhere phone in (select phone from old)\nreturning phone;",
